### ========================================================
### VlogSphere REST API Test Suite (VS Code REST Client format)
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000/api
### ========================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Register New Creator Channel
# @name signup
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sarah Miller",
  "handle": "@sarahmiller",
  "email": "sarah.miller@vlogsphere.io",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Login Creator & Receive JWT Token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sarah.miller@vlogsphere.io",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Get Current Authenticated Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Vlogs with Pagination (Page 1, Limit 4)
GET {{baseUrl}}/vlogs?page=1&limit=4
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get Vlogs Filtered by Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/vlogs?category=Travel&page=1&limit=6
Accept: application/json

### 7. Search Vlogs by Keyword (Search for 'tokyo')
GET {{baseUrl}}/vlogs?search=tokyo
Accept: application/json

### 8. Get Vlogs Sorted by Most Viewed
GET {{baseUrl}}/vlogs?sort=views&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Single Vlog Details by ID
# Replace :id with an actual MongoDB Vlog ID or seeded ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/vlogs/673c9f2b84784918e9a1c001
Accept: application/json

### 10. Publish New Vlog (Protected)
# @name createVlog
POST {{baseUrl}}/vlogs
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Winter in Hokkaido: Powder Snow, Onsens & Ramen in Otaru",
  "description": "Traveling through deep snow drifts across northern Japan. Experiencing traditional wooden ryokans and hot springs.",
  "category": "Travel",
  "tags": ["Hokkaido", "Japan", "WinterVlog", "Cinematic"],
  "thumbnail": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516467508483-a7212febe31a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80",
  "videoUrl": "https://commondatastorage.googleapis.com/gtv-videos-bucket/sample/BigBuckBunny.mp4",
  "duration": "16:45",
  "is4K": true
}

### 11. Toggle Like on Vlog (Protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/vlogs/673c9f2b84784918e9a1c001/like
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 12. Add Comment to Vlog (Protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/vlogs/673c9f2b84784918e9a1c001/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Stunning visuals! What camera lens did you use for the low-light street sequences?"
}

### 13. Toggle Subscription to Channel (Protected)
# Replace :channelId with the target Creator User ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/673c9f2b84784918e9a1b002/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 14. Get List of Subscribed Channels (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/channels
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 15. Get Creator Channel Profile by Handle
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/%40elenarostova
Accept: application/json

### 16. Get Studio Analytics & Dashboard Stats (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 17. Test Centralized 404 Error Handler
GET {{baseUrl}}/invalid-non-existent-endpoint
Accept: application/json
